source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: The only closing candidate is backslash-preceded, so Jira finds no closer and shows the escaped asterisk; jiro keeps the opener as text and decodes the escape.
-- input.jira --
*ab\*
-- rendered.html --
<p>*ab&#42;</p>
-- want.md --
\*ab\*
-- warnings.json --
[]
